SUMMARY:The Apartment (1960)
LOCATION:The Cinemagic Theater\, 2021 SE Hawthorne Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5122;-122.6366
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Billy Wilder · 126 min\n\nBud Baxter is a minor clerk in 
 a huge New York insurance company\, until he discovers a quick way to clim
 b the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a 
 place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aft
 ermath of their visits\, one night he's left with a major problem to solve
 .\n\nTickets: https://tickets.thecinemagictheater.com/checkout/showing/the
 -apartment/4139949/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small
