 led. One day\, fed up with her stuffy\, small-minded neighbours\, she comm
 issions herself a husband to be made from wicker. In an otherwise conserva
 tive town\, this unconventional romance sparks outrage\, jealousy and chao
 s.\n\nTickets: https://pdx.livingroomtheaters.com/purchase/wicker?showingI
